const SYSTEM = `You check one turn of a customer chat for an online shop that sells through WhatsApp, Messenger and Instagram, usually with cash on delivery. Customers write in Iraqi Arabic, often with typos. Some messages are voice-note transcripts ("[رسالة صوتية]: …") or labels such as "[صورة مرسلة]".

